        "node_id": "n_2_cf6204",
        "thought_text": "The current approach using dynamic programming is on the right track, but it needs to be adjusted to account for the possibility of setting a new record at any point during the run. The error likely occurs because the current implementation doesn't consider the possibility of resetting before the first trick or between tricks. Let's modify the approach to consider these scenarios and find the optimal reset points.",
